Subject: Life drawing for beginners is cancelled

Life drawing for beginners is cancelled

Hi Priya,

The class won’t happen.

The organizer said: “The room flooded.”

If PayPal was holding money for you, the hold is released. If you were charged, the refund is on its way and can take a few days; you can follow it on the private link you got when you joined.

--
The class happens, or nobody pays.
You get this because you left your email when you joined Life drawing for beginners on CommitPool.

